%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f5dcffc070f2c7d45a208d446b2d3945, type: 3}
  m_Name: MEIKO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VocaloidTCG.StoryData
  id: story-meiko
  tutorial: 0
  storyClass: 4
  header: "World Tour Auditions \u2014 MEIKO"
  playerStarterDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5666987fd47a569e2104e2d56522914c, type: 2}
  prologue:
    lines:
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: KAITO holds up the proposed tour promo. Almost every part of MEIKO's
        song is crossed out except the chorus.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b5b85eb6abd91a40bccaedc0e1e638d, type: 3}
      text: Good news! They love your chorus.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
    - speaker: MEIKO
      portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 979df520afcaa1b4aa061803fd33c53c, type: 3}
      text: And the rest of the song apparently offended them.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -8524543114665667514, guid: 7460a30688e658c408b568eb931f4b78, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: It's a fifteen-second preview.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -7620395232129107901, guid: 558dc08c762772f4c972bc45a9ae4b21, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
    - speaker: MEIKO
      portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a0f5bc9938ed0d4faf937d0c917096f, type: 3}
      text: I know. I'm not putting on a fifteen-second concert, though.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: caacf738306f3f243a0a7b5c1e66e5b9, type: 3}
      text: She takes out a red pencil and circles the full set list.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
  epilogue:
    lines:
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: MEIKO's name tops the tour poster. She checks the full opening set list
        while KAITO holds up his phone.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90d1adb21654e4b47a0ec87c86534246, type: 3}
      text: The new preview's doing well. They're asking when the full version comes
        out.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
    - speaker: MEIKO
      portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Tonight, if everyone gets onstage on time.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8fc2202936ac6d24eb745b299aecb062, type: 3}
      text: So... should I post the whole song afterward?
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: -1971943863084206274, guid: 0bca34c626aa4694aaf31971b87bd402, type: 3}
    - speaker: MEIKO
      portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a0f5bc9938ed0d4faf937d0c917096f, type: 3}
      text: Sure. First, let's give them a show worth recording.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: -7753276395421877545, guid: 710cc76e5bee0ef47a514d68f1f7b013, type: 3}
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: She tucks the red pencil behind her ear and heads toward the stage as
        the house lights dim.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: -6317423667150299997, guid: 93cb99591fd4be445b3887ccb01be9a0, type: 3}
  auditions:
  - opponent: 0
    deckDescription: Miku strengthens nearby allies and shares influence to build
      a powerful group of performers.
    location: The Lantern Courtyard
    auditionText: An audition against Miku.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 517baa67709e50446b3db9b300532c09, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2c3ebb934c6964f3099f5bca55ebf727, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e25a40858a935d10bde6f93df11bc4d9, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1e660b9fdcb991ade24445970dfdd6ed, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: caacf738306f3f243a0a7b5c1e66e5b9, type: 3}
        text: MEIKO rehearses an introduction. She stops halfway through and scratches
          out three lines.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 1414087313690171253, guid: bd2e8b9a35e8b5740a210eeda43ff22c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ea8fbebffcfcc0488b922266f3e4241, type: 3}
        text: Wait, I liked that part!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -2199009814668414564, guid: 25eb3c64c8a9d4e4dbac7f14ab53122f, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: The part where I explain the song before singing it?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5909369726638379594, guid: 15b288373541ce745b2a4fc354c46beb, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 1414087313690171253, guid: bd2e8b9a35e8b5740a210eeda43ff22c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 374b13b4db0a46947902846eacef7418, type: 3}
        text: ...When you put it like that.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6467469513183496125, guid: 64258669bcda46446a650c15765c381a, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a094dc3da7531334d958befd516b04ca, type: 3}
        text: You can tell me if you miss it after the show.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 4311828083851245686, guid: 0ed4ac1d21af8974a8e3b903b5a7c0c3, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Deal! But I'm keeping my own introduction.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5258151446683417647, guid: 4245179bb379a974db70dad1373c8ed0, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1a07c2061a74d1e458acf4b765d7ca82, type: 3}
        text: The crowd is still cheering after MEIKO's win. Miku picks up the discarded
          introduction sheet.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 8756508170796686454, guid: d93bc75ba5d83d14f859334df5b225e0, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Okay, I didn't miss it.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -4019612401329902033, guid: b1a5dee113946c043af466e0851b141e, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e37cf8fb113ec54680c920a1e8c5589, type: 3}
        text: Should I frame that sentence?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Don't get too excited. I have notes about the second verse.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6467469513183496125, guid: 64258669bcda46446a650c15765c381a, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6fe80a37505dde043ac7aa69a8752147, type: 3}
        text: Now you're talking. Let's hear them.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -6757516333526815305, guid: 9238e521754301b4fb03aad1c27c4dd1, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 4311828083851245686, guid: 0ed4ac1d21af8974a8e3b903b5a7c0c3, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 374b13b4db0a46947902846eacef7418, type: 3}
        text: First, can I borrow that pencil?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5719613917367643631, guid: 6d61bf1c798eca24b9cae4cf7ceae780, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -4019612401329902033, guid: b1a5dee113946c043af466e0851b141e, type: 3}
  - opponent: 1
    deckDescription: Len weakens and removes opposing performers to control Center
      Stage.
    location: The Rooftop Theatre
    auditionText: An audition against Len.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd492fc1e279bfd49a762f309e6a3f05, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2d8ba78264a734a6f9b87166143f8fff, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4189a5eb614f2b7b3b516155fa0906e, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 037327c14cbdf792dec514f0cc1dd2b3, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bec78704df563884aa0c7258101a385c, type: 3}
        text: Len tries the same high note for the fourth time. MEIKO sets a bottle
          of water beside him.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86a43a7e0d638924caa41d51130c82c8, type: 3}
        text: I can hit it. I just need one more try.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 8693415673057005869, guid: 9ef075f479c895643b7036e2307c9a93, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: That's what you said three tries ago.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5909369726638379594, guid: 15b288373541ce745b2a4fc354c46beb, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -956189301214819756, guid: 50d2a575c6258d946bf3eab369844e1a, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10cd307c26b17b44a9fdfb93fa289a0f, type: 3}
        text: You've never had trouble with a note?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -8751352758729138934, guid: d741e82c80bfba94dab9c3062b8c8110, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 521fde1548eb6db4b91752ddfa873053, type: 3}
        text: Ask KAITO about my first live show. Actually, don't.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5909369726638379594, guid: 15b288373541ce745b2a4fc354c46beb, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -956189301214819756, guid: 50d2a575c6258d946bf3eab369844e1a, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Now I definitely have to ask him.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 8693415673057005869, guid: 9ef075f479c895643b7036e2307c9a93, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: MEIKO wins despite a brief crack on one high note. Len meets her backstage.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 1275116586176032080, guid: 715a83d076871134280f70cb8c7d6033, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f59308f04c385614bb04cd445f366120, type: 3}
        text: You missed that note.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2109474199129327443, guid: 3464634288aedf349aea48de0f10dcdc, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I noticed.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5909369726638379594, guid: 15b288373541ce745b2a4fc354c46beb, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: But you kept going.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 3078092795626919404, guid: ab92f6b78dac17343bb3f0a9c6589283, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a0f5bc9938ed0d4faf937d0c917096f, type: 3}
        text: The rest of the song wasn't going to sing itself.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 1275116586176032080, guid: 715a83d076871134280f70cb8c7d6033, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a88adbbd4aa7a6f4ea369669d3709a3a, type: 3}
        text: Hah. Fair point.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6252771093854531909, guid: d8ae485ba1dc9cd47832f3126448021c, type: 3}
  - opponent: 2
    deckDescription: Rin creates tokens and turns discards and performers leaving
      the stage into bonuses.
    location: The Tram Depot
    auditionText: An audition against Rin.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4698621a90db6441beaf141105a6913, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0aa8f72f3a952f6ff9caeb6930ca41e8, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bad97a986d7fb1382273766afced01f8, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a10f728ff1af456731f0eb0cfb8904fa, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38069660b8a2bd94986ad53ca24c76d7, type: 3}
        text: Rin claps a fast beat while MEIKO adjusts her microphone.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7315369456398821115, guid: caa699f698d4b75498d9700e26408b49, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1b847fb167cfd83448778471b7337c6b, type: 3}
        text: Come on! This place needs something LOUD!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -8036308041886742708, guid: 9c688388a046dd24dbbc30ee2987acc9, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 521fde1548eb6db4b91752ddfa873053, type: 3}
        text: It was loud before you got here.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5909369726638379594, guid: 15b288373541ce745b2a4fc354c46beb, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7315369456398821115, guid: caa699f698d4b75498d9700e26408b49, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da046eee1d715734e955c7a375ebed5c, type: 3}
        text: That's a compliment, right?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6891710502897521986, guid: c688d2633af154e4b9f2194e663a7494, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a094dc3da7531334d958befd516b04ca, type: 3}
        text: Sure. Let's see if you can make it through the slow part without speeding
          up.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6498270370585485129, guid: 6a005da741980b346901fdcc3c26ab52, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Oh, it's a challenge now?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -8036308041886742708, guid: 9c688388a046dd24dbbc30ee2987acc9, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: A few people call for MEIKO's quiet opening verse again. Rin looks
          offended on principle.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 8756508170796686454, guid: d93bc75ba5d83d14f859334df5b225e0, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 8466827584194706362, guid: 91240b5a94dd0f54e905a9904b43083c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da046eee1d715734e955c7a375ebed5c, type: 3}
        text: Seriously? They want the slow bit?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6138499018571659458, guid: 9890fb00517102f4589d9d41eb6c2ce2, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a0f5bc9938ed0d4faf937d0c917096f, type: 3}
        text: You could sing it with me.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1521368860836332526, guid: 18538c62a586e8e40880ac3a43b0ccca, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 8466827584194706362, guid: 91240b5a94dd0f54e905a9904b43083c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1bc9f44978538da4bbc4d26819f0996e, type: 3}
        text: At that speed? I'll fall asleep!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 8756508170796686454, guid: d93bc75ba5d83d14f859334df5b225e0, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6138499018571659458, guid: 9890fb00517102f4589d9d41eb6c2ce2, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a094dc3da7531334d958befd516b04ca, type: 3}
        text: Then I'll wake you when it's your turn.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 8466827584194706362, guid: 91240b5a94dd0f54e905a9904b43083c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: ...Fine. But next time, we do my version too.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7355067111040609753, guid: e47f0b211c7a9ca4f9fa87c85034581c, type: 3}
  - opponent: 3
    deckDescription: Kaito moves performers around the stage and rewards allies for
      spreading across columns.
    location: The Harbor Stage
    auditionText: An audition against KAITO.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d28d46c05f34dc42a2f4d71bc30cc0a, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e3b30fb588f79c49aed6fc243283b8b7, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed6cee514bf29a43372c939ab3da0f18, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f63d3f6c9481491c655759b698f5b58a, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 682795b77894b8048962b6fbd2fbe8ff, type: 3}
        text: KAITO plays MEIKO a proposed fifteen-second promo clip on his phone.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1025957635999731651, guid: e299bec22c3e3b04ca06e0001ac7ca64, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: This is the version the organizers want to post.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6506257976614099797, guid: e953fd9f6a3a3334884fede5ea8b3148, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9d355bacee203f447a4b71bac5fee8ca, type: 3}
        text: It cuts off in the middle of my sentence.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -8524543114665667514, guid: 7460a30688e658c408b568eb931f4b78, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Technically, the middle of your verse.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7620395232129107901, guid: 558dc08c762772f4c972bc45a9ae4b21, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 979df520afcaa1b4aa061803fd33c53c, type: 3}
        text: Thank you, that's much better.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -8524543114665667514, guid: 7460a30688e658c408b568eb931f4b78, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 679c29afef9d19a45af7c923d6851231, type: 3}
        text: ...I'll take that as a no.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7620395232129107901, guid: 558dc08c762772f4c972bc45a9ae4b21, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 44b2cc1e8cbf14f449480c10d3479188, type: 3}
        text: KAITO shows MEIKO a recording of the audience leaning forward before
          her quiet verse.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90d1adb21654e4b47a0ec87c86534246, type: 3}
        text: Look. They all leaned in right here.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a0f5bc9938ed0d4faf937d0c917096f, type: 3}
        text: That's where we should end the preview.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c6701a018f1b0a429bb4ad9e5451294, type: 3}
        text: Right before the verse? That's cruel.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -1971943863084206274, guid: 0bca34c626aa4694aaf31971b87bd402, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a094dc3da7531334d958befd516b04ca, type: 3}
        text: They can hear the rest at the show.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -7753276395421877545, guid: 710cc76e5bee0ef47a514d68f1f7b013, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: ...I see what you're doing.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
  - opponent: 5
    deckDescription: Luka contests Center Stage and builds audience score to unlock
      discounts and stronger buffs.
    location: The Planetarium
    auditionText: An audition against Luka.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 91dddab74da60da46b7e8e01c70d7f3a, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ceb93133aa9561c6a872dab0cfa2c39e, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f4b2837e43d5e0cbd469618d517077ef, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1256f254a989b509dcc07792658e523, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 745a7f666834c3e4da40c0b7d9a887f9, type: 3}
        text: Luka shows MEIKO two lyric sheets with the same melody and different
          words.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f97c4c4f3f9059843b2b0e0e76996353, type: 3}
        text: I can't choose which verse to sing.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2541232186797710645, guid: 8c2198f91143d7040ab0170e51459e2c, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Why not use both?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 659807028895115265, guid: d5deaaf6772957344b6b32b1640b27d3, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 672266309e3b51746a62a805028a9457, type: 3}
        text: One asks someone to stay. The other tells them to go.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2541232186797710645, guid: 8c2198f91143d7040ab0170e51459e2c, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a0f5bc9938ed0d4faf937d0c917096f, type: 3}
        text: Try them in a different order. See how they sound together.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 659807028895115265, guid: d5deaaf6772957344b6b32b1640b27d3, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I'll give it a try.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 848881099071188197, guid: 991781bd03c8bb64192e8c3d64485d96, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: After MEIKO's win, Luka shows her an updated arrangement backstage.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I tried both verses, like you suggested.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 848881099071188197, guid: 991781bd03c8bb64192e8c3d64485d96, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6a781d5a6cef65b4b8d74cddaa51c5ed, type: 3}
        text: How'd they sound?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 659807028895115265, guid: d5deaaf6772957344b6b32b1640b27d3, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Better. I kept the pause before the second one.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 3056756451418170359, guid: 624cf8f3ecbd433438e399a5ac16bc87, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a0f5bc9938ed0d4faf937d0c917096f, type: 3}
        text: Then keep it. It's your arrangement.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -7160719286429738108, guid: 041fa33cda16c7044aeada8e9029e9e9, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 42370bfa4dea98e43bf31c637f1c730d, type: 3}
        text: I think I will.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 2548522690004552740, guid: e6534b77d828d09428b757174e8ed8be, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 3056756451418170359, guid: 624cf8f3ecbd433438e399a5ac16bc87, type: 3}
